sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant Web as Admin Web Portal
    participant API as Content Import (admin role check)
    participant ST as Supabase Storage
    participant JOB as Import Worker (background)
    participant LLM as Gemini (Writing extraction)
    participant TTS as Gemini Text-to-Speech
    participant EMB as Gemini Embedding
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    A->>Web: Download template, upload Listening CSV or Writing prompt file
    Web->>API: POST /v1/admin/imports {kind, file}
    API->>API: Check role, file type and size
    API->>ST: Store file (private bucket)
    API->>DB: INSERT import_job (queued)
    API-->>Web: 202 {job_id}
    JOB->>DB: Take job, status = processing
    alt Listening (CSV file)
        JOB->>JOB: Parse rows (clip_code, line or question), group into clips
        JOB->>JOB: Validate (columns, max 2 speakers, length limit, 4 distinct options, 1 answer, explanation) - BR-37
    else Writing
        JOB->>LLM: Split prompts, scoring note, word range, topic, level
        JOB->>EMB: Embed each prompt
        JOB->>DB: Compare with active prompts, similarity ≥ 0.95 → duplicate warning
    end
    JOB->>DB: preview + warnings, status = preview_ready
    A->>Web: Edit cards (errors shown by row), delete or "Process again"
    opt Listening
        A->>Web: Check or change the voice of each speaker, "Generate audio"
        Web->>API: POST /v1/admin/imports/{id}/clips/{n}/tts
        API->>TTS: Transcript, voices, style by CEFR level
        TTS-->>API: Audio (WAV)
        API->>ST: Store draft audio (private bucket)
        API-->>Web: Signed URL, duration
        A->>Web: Listen, and generate again after any change to text or voices
    end
    A->>Web: Save
    Web->>API: POST /v1/admin/imports/{id}/save
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    alt Listening
        API->>API: Every clip has audio for its current text and voices
        API->>ST: Copy audio to listening-audio bucket
        API->>DB: INSERT listening_clip (voice_config, tts_model) + question_bank (active)
    else Writing
        API->>EMB: Re-embed edited prompts
        API->>DB: INSERT question_bank (writing_prompt, active, embedding)
    end
    API->>DB: import_job saved, INSERT admin_action_log, COMMIT
    API-->>Web: 201, content available to learners immediately
    A->>Web: Retire an item
    Web->>API: POST /v1/admin/question-bank/{id}/retire
    API->>DB: status = retired, expire cache entries generated from it (BR-25), log
